sociation":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description of the problem / feature request:\r\n\r\ncc @ola-rozenfeld \r\n\r\nI'm using 0.10.1 plus cherry-picks of fixes for #3360 — I cherry-picked 8896d2e211c57453359566c4520615c1c1f75b66 and 9e344ec089f3f46ac6d4cdf2638b671242f87631 onto the top of 0.10.1.\r\n\r\nWhen compiling a large project on Mac (sorry, I don't have a small repro case for you), I saw this warning about ten times:\r\n\r\n    WARNING: /dev/null was modified during execution\r\n\r\nIf you do `ls -l /dev/null` on a Mac, you'll see that its timestamp is continually changing.\r\n\r\nI wouldn't be surprised if this is related to 3e28868f63692b3a57a3d22a2dabc18395f24ceb, which added this line:\r\n\r\n    static final ActionInput EMPTY_FILE = new EmptyActionInput(\"/dev/null\");\r\n\r\n### Feature requests: what underlying problem are you trying to solve with this feature?\r\n\r\nJust fixing a spurious warning.\r\n\r\n### Bugs: what's the simplest, easiest way to reproduce this bug? Please provide a minimal example if possible.\r\n\r\nSorry, I don't have a small repro case. I compiled a large project on Mac.\r\n\r\nIf you do `ls -l /dev/null` on any Mac, you'll see that its timestamp is continually changing. That does not seem to be the case on the one Linux system that I tried.\r\n\r\n### What operating system are you running Bazel on?\r\n\r\nmacOS 10.13.3\r\n\r\n### What's the output of `bazel info release`?\r\n\r\nAs described above, I am running 0.10.1 plus several cherry-picks.\r\n\r\n### What's the output of `git remote get-url origin ; git rev-parse master ; git rev-parse HEAD` ?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/Asana/bazel.git\r\n1c7e5815c8a5af38f7c8bf3b764cfa51158f7247\r\na9c02b030a1ad6cb7fd824d92d5fbb1ea1563fad\r\n\r\n###  Have you found anything relevant by searching the web?\r\n\r\nNo.\r\n\r\n### Any other information, logs, or outputs that you want to share?\r\n\r\nNo.","closed_by":{"login":"jin","id":347918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NzkxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/347918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin","html_url":"https://github.com/jin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/4647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/4647/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}